en to all three statements')}</h3><p>{t('선택은 바꿀 수 있어요. 최종 지목은 한 번뿐!','You can change your selection. Your final accusation is one-time only.')}</p><div className="suspect-options">{actors.map((s,i)=><button key={s.id} disabled={!readyToAccuse||phase==='resolving'} aria-pressed={selected===s.id} onClick={()=>setSelected(s.id)} data-testid={`choose-${s.id}`}><b style={{background:colors[i]}}>{i+1}</b>{s.displayName}</button>)}</div><button className="primary" disabled={!readyToAccuse||!selected||phase==='resolving'} onClick={()=>void accuse()} data-testid="accuse">{phase==='resolving'?t('잠깐의 정적…','A moment of silence…'):selected?t(`${actors.find(s=>s.id===selected)?.displayName}, 너를 지목할게!`,`Accuse ${actors.find(s=>s.id===selected)?.displayName}!`):t('최종 지목하기','Make the accusation')}<span>↗</span></button></div></>}
